                     <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">     </span>Application Fee Wavier Instructions :</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>1. Fill, sign, and attach the<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span><a href="https://www.calstate.edu/apply/paying-for-college/Documents/undergraduate-application-fee-waiver-appeal-form-2023-24.pdf" style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-align:justify;font-family:'Myriad Pro';font-size:12pt">CSU Application Fee Wavier form</a>.</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>2. In your personal statement, detail the change in income &amp; circumstances.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>3. Provide a copy of a recent pay stub, if available, which includes year-to-date earnings.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-tab-count:1">         </span>4. Include other documents as appropriate to support your request<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p></body>
